# Tutorials

Each tutorial starts from a checked-in example so you can join later. Finish
[your first component](/docs/tutorials/first-component/) before the
application sequence.

1. [Build your first component](/docs/tutorials/first-component/) — styling example
2. [Build your first standalone app](/docs/tutorials/first-app/) — counter
3. [Compose a small application](/docs/tutorials/compose/) — modules, lists, forms
4. [Add commands and live updates](/docs/tutorials/commands-and-live/) — live-counter
5. [Take ownership with main.roc](/docs/tutorials/custom-main/) — datastar gallery
6. [Ship the application](/docs/tutorials/ship/) — release server and macOS bundle
